\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Chen2020 search diagnostics. \emph  {Left:} representative canonical-HV trajectories. The LLMBO-MO and ParEGO centerlines are from seed~8409; NSGA-II, DISK, and PIMD are five-seed means. The LLMBO-MO and ParEGO ribbons are archived proxy dispersion envelopes and are not confidence intervals; the remaining ribbons show one sample standard deviation. \emph  {Right:} five-seed mean number of nondominated charging protocols, with $\pm 1$ sample-standard-deviation bands. The underlying archives contain different initial database sizes, so the right panel is used only to describe archive growth.}}{7}{}\protected@file@percent }
